  "bad_candidate_cap": {
    "error": "",
    "exit": "[launch] --fk_candidate_cap must be an integer >= 1, got '0'. It is the number of parent candidates kept per SHARED value on a conditional edge (ADR 0037): 0 divides the keys_per_batch bound by zero, and a negative cap empties every candidate list silently. Use 64 (the default) or higher."
  },
